### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8005/api/v1/health
Content-Type: application/json


### Upload Image
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Get Image by ID
GET http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/{{image_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### List Images
GET http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images?limit=10&offset=0&sort=desc
Content-Type: application/json

### Resize Image
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/resize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "width": 800,
  "height": 600
}

### Convert Image Format
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "format": "png"
}

### Apply Filter
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "filter": "grayscale"
}

### Crop Image
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/crop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "width": 500,
  "height": 500,
  "x": 100,
  "y": 100
}

### Rotate Image
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/rotate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "angle": 90
}

### Flip Image
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/flip
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "flip_axis": "horizontal"
}

### Add Watermark
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/watermark
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "watermark": "watermark_public_id"
}

### Compress Image
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/images/compress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{image_id}}",
  "quality": "auto"
}

### Upload Video
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/videos/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./path/to/your/video.mp4
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Get Video by ID
GET http://localhost:8005/api/v1/videos/{{video_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### List Videos
GET http://localhost:8005/api/v1/videos?limit=10&offset=0&sort=desc
Content-Type: application/json
